# pair_style pace RECURSIVE (ML-PACE) comparator on the same box.
#   -var box <box file>  -var yace <file.yace|.ace>  -var steps <n>
# `recursive` is stated explicitly: the plan's protocol compares against the recursive
# evaluator, and `pair_style pace` on its own leaves the choice to the build's default.
include ${box}
pair_style pace recursive
pair_coeff * * ${yace} ${species}
velocity all create 300.0 4928459
fix 1 all nve
timestep 0.0
thermo 50
run ${steps}
